### Payment Service API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments
### Via Gateway: http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments

### =============================================
### Process Payment (Direct to Payment Service)
### =============================================

### Process a new payment with credit card
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "customerId": 1001,
  "amount": 45.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "paymentMethodType": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "cardNumber": "4111111111111111",
  "cardHolderName": "John Doe",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2026,
  "cvv": "123",
  "savePaymentMethod": true
}

###

### Process payment with PayPal
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 2,
  "customerId": 1001,
  "amount": 29.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "paymentMethodType": "PAYPAL"
}

###

### Process payment that will always fail (card ending 0000)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 3,
  "customerId": 1002,
  "amount": 15.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "paymentMethodType": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "cardNumber": "4111111111110000",
  "cardHolderName": "Test Fail",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2025,
  "cvv": "123"
}

###

### Process Cash on Delivery payment
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 4,
  "customerId": 1003,
  "amount": 35.75,
  "currency": "USD",
  "paymentMethodType": "CASH_ON_DELIVERY"
}

###

### =============================================
### Get Payment Information
### =============================================

### Get payment by transaction ID (replace with actual UUID)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/{{transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get payment by order ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/order/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get all payments for a customer
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/customer/1001
Content-Type: application/json

###

### =============================================
### Process Refund
### =============================================

### Process full refund (replace transactionId with actual UUID)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "orderId": 1,
  "amount": 45.99,
  "reason": "Customer requested cancellation"
}

###

### Process partial refund
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "orderId": 1,
  "amount": 10.00,
  "reason": "Item unavailable"
}

###

### =============================================
### Payment Methods
### =============================================

### Get customer's saved payment methods
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/methods/1001
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Delete (deactivate) a payment method (replace with actual UUID)
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/v1/payments/methods/{{paymentMethodId}}
Content-Type: application/json

